        "created_at": "2014-02-08T23:03:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a question about taking off the markers in Setback's Unlucky Pool.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Say I have 1 in the pool. The card then says \"Remove 2 tokens.\" Since I only have 1, I can't remove 2. Do I have to remove the 1? If I do remove the 1, do I still get to use the \"If you did...\" text that follows it?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:16.034Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
