        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I have a question about taking off the markers in Setback&#39;s Unlucky Pool.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Say I have 1 in the pool. The card then says &quot;Remove 2 tokens.&quot; Since I only have 1, I can&#39;t remove 2. Do I have to remove the 1? If I do remove the 1, do I still get to use the &quot;If you did...&quot; text that follows it?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
